{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:11WorldModule8RelationP","roleHeading":"Protocol","title":"Relation","symbolKind":"protocol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Relations.swift#L61","fileName":"Relations.swift"}},"abstract":[{"text":"A type that describes a kind of link from one entity to others.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn"]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation"},"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","kind":"relationships","type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"]},{"title":"Conforming Types","kind":"relationships","type":"conformingTypes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Relating Entities","generated":true,"anchor":"Relating-Entities","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CleanupAction"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Relation"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","text":"Sendable"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A relation links a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"source"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entity to one or more "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"target","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entities: a unit likes another,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a turret is aimed at a ship, a part is a child of its parent ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf"},{"type":"text","text":"). Declare a relation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a type that conforms to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Relation"},{"type":"text","text":", then link entities with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/relate(_:_:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Likes: Relation {}","","var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","world.relate(alice, Likes(), to: bob)","","print(world.targets(Likes.self, of: alice) == [bob])","\/\/ Prints \"true\"","print(world.sources(Likes.self, of: bob) == [alice])","\/\/ Prints \"true\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The world stores each link as a pair of a target and a value of the relation, so a relation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can carry data about the link:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct Owes: Relation { var amount: Int }","","var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","world.relate(alice, Owes(amount: 20), to: bob)","","if let debt = world[Targets<Owes>.self, of: alice][bob] {","    print(debt.amount)","    \/\/ Prints \"20\"","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Querying-Relations","text":"Querying Relations"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A source holds its pairs of a relation in a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","type":"reference"},{"text":" component, so you can read and filter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on it like any other component. The world also keeps an index of each target’s sources, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"filtering a query with ","type":"text"},{"code":".related(_:to:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" visits only the entities related to that target:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let alice = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Alice\"))","let bob = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Bob\"))","let carol = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Carol\"))","world.relate(alice, Likes(), to: bob)","world.relate(carol, Likes(), to: bob)","","let fans = world.query(Name.self).related(Likes.self, to: bob).map { $0.1.value }","print(fans.sorted())","\/\/ Prints \"[\"Alice\", \"Carol\"]\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Customizing-a-Relation","text":"Customizing a Relation"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"By default a source can relate to any number of targets, and despawning a target removes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its pairs from the sources. Implement "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to change that."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation/isExclusive":{"type":"topic","defaultImplementations":1,"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation\/isexclusive","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/isExclusive","title":"isExclusive","required":true,"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isExclusive"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Boolean value indicating whether a source relates to at most one target."}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Targets":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The component that holds a source entity’s targets of a relation, with the relation’s value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for each."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/targets","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Targets","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","title":"Targets","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Targets","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/relate(_:_:to:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Links a source entity to a target entity by a relation.","type":"text"}],"title":"relate(_:_:to:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/relate(_:_:to:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/relate(_:_:to:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"relate"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"R"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/CleanupAction":{"role":"symbol","title":"CleanupAction","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CleanupAction","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/cleanupaction","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CleanupAction","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CleanupAction","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"What despawning a relation’s target does to the sources related to it.","type":"text"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ChildOf":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/childof","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The relation that links a child entity to its parent."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","title":"ChildOf","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ChildOf","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/SavingAndLoadingWorlds":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/savingandloadingworlds","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Save a world’s entities and components, restore them later, and spawn saved groups of entities"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into other worlds."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://WorldModule/s8SendableP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"Swift.Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule","abstract":[{"text":"Store the state of a game or simulation as entities and components, and read and change it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"queries, updates, and commands.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","title":"WorldModule","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A type that describes a kind of link from one entity to others.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Relation","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Relation","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/Relation/onTargetDespawn":{"required":true,"abstract":[{"text":"What despawning a target does to the sources related to it.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"onTargetDespawn","defaultImplementations":1,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation\/onTargetDespawn","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onTargetDespawn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CleanupAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule13CleanupActionO"}],"url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/relation\/ontargetdespawn"}}}